          "Psalm 120"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Prayer for Rescue from the Treacherous."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Song of Ascents."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I cried to the Lord in my trouble,",
          "And He answered me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Rescue my soul, Lord, from lying lips,",
          "From a deceitful tongue."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "What will He give to you, and what more will He do to you,",
          "You deceitful tongue?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sharp arrows of the warrior,",
          "With the burning coals of the broom tree!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Woe to me, for I reside in Meshech,",
          "For I have settled among the tents of Kedar!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Too long has my soul had its dwelling",
          "With those who hate peace."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I am for peace, but when I speak,",
          "They are for war."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
